OL,3,GNEWSAOne-way high street sparks mixed
OL,4,Areaction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA decision to permanently reopen a high
OL,7,Fstreet to cars has drawn mixed
OL,8,Freactions from neighbouring businesses
OL,9,Fand shops.
OL,11,FCalne High Street had been
OL,12,Fpedestrianised since 1968 but is now
OL,13,Fopen one-way to traffic travelling
OL,14,Fsouth from Wood Street to Curzon Street
OL,15,Ffollowing an 18-month, #100,000 trial
OL,16,Fby Wiltshire Council.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,350,340,200,160,0,100
