OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1787212546
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAOne-way high street sparks mixed
OL,4,Areaction
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council said the change had reduced
OL,7,Ftraffic volumes in the town and
OL,8,Fimproved journey times, with chairman
OL,9,Fof Marden Community Hub, Dawn Perkins,
OL,10,Falso saying the change had positively
OL,11,Fimpacted footfall.
OL,13,FBut for Kirsty Gray, founder of
OL,14,Fresearch and genealogy firm Family
OL,15,FWise, the noise pollution had sometimes
OL,16,Fbeen too much.
